	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Accepi literas tuas, vir clarissime, per presentem tabellarium, sed <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>priores, quas ad me scripsisse dicis cum <persName ref="p2916">Schertelii</persName> literis, non accepi.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Certe, ut scribis, bene nobiscum actum fuisset, si <persName>rex Brebantiam</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>invasisset, et illud fuit magistri equitum consilium, cum videret <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>hostem nullibi apparere; sed alii dissuaserunt, quum viderent indies <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>morbos augeri, et certe non pauci gravissime ęgrotant.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><persName>Cardinalis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Lothoringus</persName> nescio an convaluerit; laborabat febri pestilentiali.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Rex non parum fecit hoc anno; multa enim alia cepit castra, de <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quibus nulla fit mentio, et libenter vident rustici nostri Campaniae l<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>imites tam longe protendisse.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dominus quoque de <placeName>Sedan</placeName>, qui a marchia <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>vocatur, fortissimum castrum cępit, quod aliquando Cesar parenti <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ademerat; <placeName>Boullon</placeName> est illi nomen, non longe a <placeName>Sedano</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Audio tuis literis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>miram <persName ref="p18538">Cesaris</persName> expeditionem, que tarde incipit; nam supersunt tantum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>duo menses usque ad hyemem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Oportet, ut principes sibi consulant; <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nam quod effecerunt, parum est, nisi possint conatibus <persName ref="p18538">Cesaris</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>obviam ire.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Certissima sunt, que de <placeName ref="l834">Italis</placeName> et <placeName ref="l875">Hispanis</placeName> scribis; nam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>eadem ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> nunciantur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Negocia regis in <placeName ref="l736">Pedemontana</placeName> provincia <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>bene habent; occupata est a nostris arx <persName>Verone</persName><note type="margin">a.R.: Recone?</note> fortissima in <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>marquionatu <persName>Montferrat</persName> contra spem <placeName>Hispanorum</placeName>, qui super portam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>lapideum porcum extruxerunt, ab ore huius uva pendebat etiam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>lapidea et eorum lingua vernacula duo carmina affixerant, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>qui idem sonabant, ac si diceres: quum porcus hanc uvam <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>comederit, Galli castrum ingredientur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tamen ab <placeName ref="l834">Italis</placeName> nostris <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nec sine astu capta est; nam simulavit gubernator <placeName ref="l736">Pedemontanus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>velle alio ire et aliud castrum invadere ascendereque iussit per <placeName>Padum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>aliquas magnas bombardas.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Illico <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanensis</placeName> gubernator <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>accurrit castrum illud defensurus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed nocte iussit <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>descendere bombardas mareschallus noster per <placeName>Padum</placeName>, ita <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ut <placeName>Verone</placeName> diluculo appulerunt et tam furiose invaserunt nostri Itali, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ut ingressi fuerint castrum et <placeName>Hispanos</placeName> omnes occiderint.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Quam rem valde ęgre tulit gubernator <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanensis</placeName>; est enim <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>illud castrum magni ponderis.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ideo cogitat, quibus artibus <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>poterit iterum habere, quod vix domino adiuvante fiet; habet <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>enim, que sunt necessaria et est omnino situm in rupe distans <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>octo tantum milliaribus a <placeName>Versellis</placeName>, ubi habet sedem <persName ref="p18536">dux Sabaudiae</persName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p974">Molineus</persName>, vir certe simplex, ad modum te salutat.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>29. iulii 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Tuus ex animo <lb xml:id="p1z40"/><persName ref="p944">Maurilius Musaeus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo ac eruditissimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesiastae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="attachment">[Notiz von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Iulii 29. 1552.</s>
				</p>
